# FORMAT-03 ETC2 golden manifest.
#
# Each line selects one vendored PKM fixture and records the canonical
# decode evidence produced by the upstream Wuffs decoder
# (wuffs-mirror-release-c/release/c/wuffs-v0.4.c, the exact decoder embedded
# in the wasm guest) using the guest's decode parameters from wasm/shim.c:
# pixel format BGRA_PREMUL, blend SRC, workbuf = workbuf_len().max_incl. The
# CRC-32 (IEEE) is over the width*height*4 straight (non-premultiplied) RGBA
# bytes the Go host writes into the caller's image.RGBA Pix, i.e. the raw
# guest bytes with B and R swapped and each channel unpremultiplied via
# (c*255)/a, matching convertBGRAToStraight. Values were computed by an
# independent C oracle program against the upstream decoder; none were taken
# from this package's own decoder.
#
# Columns: file width height straight_rgba_crc32 pkm_variant
bricks-color.etc1.pkm 160 120 1473109472 ETC1_RGB
bricks-color.etc1s.pkm 160 120 133114617 ETC1S
bricks-color.etc2.pkm 160 120 1591528539 ETC2_RGB
mona-lisa.21x32.etc2.pkm 21 32 2386654191 ETC2_RGB
hippopotamus.masked-with-muybridge.etc2.bgra-binary.pkm 36 28 4212096358 ETC2_RGBA1
hippopotamus.masked-with-muybridge.etc2.bgra-nonpremul.pkm 36 28 1849481479 ETC2_RGBA